'''Lust''' is a [[mini-boss]] and one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins]].

== Behavior ==
* Lust chases Isaac around the room at a fast speed, attempting to do contact damage.
** She builds speed the longer she travels without turning and takes heavily reduced knockback from Isaac's tears.
Lust deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* Having high [[speed]] will make the fight much easier.
* {{dlc|nr}} Lust can drop {{i|The Virus}} even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it.

== Unlockable [[Achievements]] ==
{{achievement text | The Book of Sin }}

== Trivia ==
* Lust is confirmed to be female.<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1022278876586635264</ref>
* {{i|The Virus}} gives Isaac a lumpy appearance that looks similar to Lust's appearance.
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.
* Lust's sickly appearance and chance to drop {{i|The Virus}} may be a reference to sexually transmitted diseases.
* Lust is a personification of one of the Seven Deadly Sins. Lust is sexual immorality in all its forms. It is believed to lead to impulsivity, dullness in religious thinking, inconstancy, and worldliness — as well as violence and hatred towards God in more extreme forms.

